@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Serif CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
hide empty description
state "接收中\n读者不可见" as Receiving
state "提交中\n头片段最后写" as Committing
state "可读取\n校验后的完整对象" as Readable
state "失败 / 失效\n不可新命中" as Invalid
[*] --> Receiving : 取得写入所有权及 FillToken
Receiving --> Committing : 正文完整且校验通过
Receiving --> Invalid : 错误 / 取消 / 超时
Committing --> Readable : 写入完成且版本 / 所有权 / token 有效
Committing --> Invalid : 写失败或围栏失效
Readable --> Invalid : PURGE / 替换 / 环形覆盖
Invalid --> [*]
note right of Readable
  manifest、每个逻辑块均是独立完整对象
  可读提交不等于逐块 fsync
  已发送字节不能撤回
end note
@enduml
